<td id="_fef8aaab-ac05-15a4-d2bf-2b8aaaaa1f15" valign="top" align="left" semx-id="_fef8aaab-ac05-15a4-d2bf-2b8aaaaa1f15"/></tr><tr id="_dea38c3e-f81b-5ffe-0896-50c7f677e085" semx-id="_dea38c3e-f81b-5ffe-0896-50c7f677e085"><th id="_c3da8989-c870-d768-2791-fc70a90ba0ac" valign="top" align="left" semx-id="_c3da8989-c870-d768-2791-fc70a90ba0ac"><strong>S-4</strong></th>
<td id="_3ae8ee96-16b7-0628-6b88-0f9dd6980c46" valign="top" align="left" semx-id="_3ae8ee96-16b7-0628-6b88-0f9dd6980c46"/></tr><tr id="_ac952ad9-9d01-814e-8d2d-cd09b94fa74c" semx-id="_ac952ad9-9d01-814e-8d2d-cd09b94fa74c"><th id="_93f59001-83d8-69ef-f82e-fe5a54116781" valign="top" align="left" semx-id="_93f59001-83d8-69ef-f82e-fe5a54116781"><strong>Remarks</strong></th>
<td id="_5c7e3300-4e6e-adf2-5144-abc8688cb9fc" valign="top" align="left" semx-id="_5c7e3300-4e6e-adf2-5144-abc8688cb9fc"><p id="_7717fc49-da90-50bd-8798-69112cfa4d59" semx-id="_7717fc49-da90-50bd-8798-69112cfa4d59">Realized from ISO 19152 LADM “LA_Party”  which stereotypes this object as a “featureType”. Since it is not a feature in the same sense as the term feature is used in IHO S-100, the stereotype has been removed. LA_GroupParty describes  any number of parties, forming together a distinct entity, with each party registered. Since LA_GroupParty is a subtype of LA_Party this is described as a single class “Party” that includes a conditional attribute “partyGroupTypeList” that defines the type of a group party.</p>
</td>
</tr></tbody>
</table>
</clause>

