<td id="_1514636e-a21e-66b6-f5c5-2de52a8040cb" valign="top" align="left" semx-id="_1514636e-a21e-66b6-f5c5-2de52a8040cb"><p id="_eadd51f5-c8b2-ebf2-6f8c-88bb9bf460f4" semx-id="_eadd51f5-c8b2-ebf2-6f8c-88bb9bf460f4">This is the official description of the point in a textual form, so that the exact representation of the point may be maintained in terms of degrees and decimal degrees, or degrees, minutes and seconds, or other description. A reference system (CRS) shall be included where available. A CRS is required, but it may only be included in the base text and therefore only included by reference through a Source object.</p>
</td>
</tr><tr id="_387fb141-0706-e405-85c3-c49c7ecbf177" semx-id="_387fb141-0706-e405-85c3-c49c7ecbf177"><th id="_e5d49ffa-4129-4878-69f0-2c2cf21ed74c" valign="top" align="left" semx-id="_e5d49ffa-4129-4878-69f0-2c2cf21ed74c"><strong>Quantity Specifications</strong></th>
